{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52938","headline":"题石门洞 · 释玄宗","name":"题石门洞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"密竹流泉不居热，洞门深沉风雨歇。\n洗出清风快活天，醉弄江南谢家月。\n（见《康熙青田县志》卷十二《艺文》下「七言绝」。\n以上二首，皆承张靖龙同志录示。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"释玄宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52938.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52938","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}